# Deferred: Profile pull-to-refresh feel

**Status:** Parked. Revisit later. Do not change pull-to-refresh behavior unless the user asks.

## Desired behavior

Make pull-to-refresh **page-snap / threshold-commit** — content stays pinned on a half-pull (no spinner peek); only engage refresh after a full commit past the threshold.

Reference feel: ItemDetailView Item ↔ Worn hero `TabView` with `.tabViewStyle(.page)`.

## Current baseline

- Own Profile and other-user remote wardrobe grids both use `UIRefreshControl` via `ProfileNestedScrollContainer`.
- Standard `UIRefreshControl` peeks the spinner during rubber-band overscroll before refresh commits.

## When revisiting

- Hide or suppress the spinner until refresh actually begins (`beginRefreshing` / past commit threshold).
- Keep nested scroll coordination and `refreshOverscrollLimit` working.
